body:
The Quick Start schema uses an object-style `onClick` handler (e.g., `{ type: 'log', message: ... }`). In `@object-ui/types`, `onClick` is modeled as a function in the Zod component schemas, and the declarative action model uses different shapes (e.g., `ActionSchema` with `endpoint`, or `EventHandler` with `dialog/api/toast` fields). Please align this example with the actual supported action/event schema so copy/paste users don’t end up with non-working handlers.
```suggestion
      events: {
        onClick: [
          {
            action: 'log',
            params: {
              message: 'Form submitted!',
            },
          },
        ],
```

This tutorial’s schema uses a declarative `onClick` dialog/action object (e.g., `onClick: { type: 'dialog', title, content: ... }`). The current `@object-ui/types` action/event types model dialog actions differently (see `EventHandler` in `api-types.ts` and `ActionSchema` in `ui-action.ts`), and Zod component schemas currently validate `onClick` as a function. Please update the example to match the supported schema/action format to avoid broken copy/paste.
```suggestion
              events: {
                onClick: [
                  {
                    action: 'openDialog',
                    params: {
                      title: 'Create New Task',
                      content: {
                        type: 'form',
                        fields: [
                          {
                            type: 'field',
                            fieldType: 'text',
                            name: 'title',
                            label: 'Task Title',
                            placeholder: 'Enter task title',
                            required: true,
                          },
                          {
                            type: 'field',
                            fieldType: 'textarea',
                            name: 'description',
                            label: 'Description',
                            placeholder: 'Task description...',
                            rows: 3,
                          },
                          {
                            type: 'field',
                            fieldType: 'select',
                            name: 'status',
                            label: 'Status',
                            options: [
                              { label: 'Todo', value: 'todo' },
                              { label: 'In Progress', value: 'in_progress' },
                              { label: 'Done', value: 'done' },
                            ],
                            defaultValue: 'todo',
                          },
                          {
                            type: 'field',
                            fieldType: 'select',
                            name: 'priority',
                            label: 'Priority',
                            options: [
                              { label: 'Low', value: 'low' },
                              { label: 'Medium', value: 'medium' },
                              { label: 'High', value: 'high' },
                            ],
                            defaultValue: 'medium',
                          },
                          {
                            type: 'field',
                            fieldType: 'date',
                            name: 'dueDate',
                            label: 'Due Date',
                          },
                        ],
                        events: {
                          onSubmit: [
                            {
                              action: 'notify',
                              params: {
                                message: 'Task created successfully!',
                              },
                            },
                          ],
                        },
                      },
                    },
                  },
                ],
```
